.TH "RPM-PLUGIN-SYSLOG" "8" "2026-03-06" "RPM 6.0.1"
.PP
.SH "نام (NAME)"
.PP
rpm-plugin-syslog \- Syslog plugin for the RPM Package Manager
.PP
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
The plugin writes basic information about \fBrpm\fR(8) transactions to the syslog -
like transactions run and packages installed or removed.\&
.PP
.SH "پیکربندی (CONFIGURATION)"
.PP
There are currently no options for this plugin in particular.\& See
\fBrpm-plugins\fR(8) on how to control plugins in general.\&
.PP
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.PP
\fBrpm\fR(8), \fBrpm-plugins\fR(8)
